<p class="eyebrow">Security</p><h1>Set up two-factor authentication</h1><div class="card form-card"><p>Scan this QR code with a compatible authenticator app, then enter the code it shows. Two-factor authentication is not enabled until this confirmation succeeds.</p><div class="totp-setup"><?php if($setup['qr']): ?><img class="qr-image" src="<?= e($setup['qr']) ?>" alt="Authenticator setup QR code"><?php else: ?><p class="alert alert-warning">QR rendering is unavailable on this server. Use the manual key below.</p><?php endif; ?><div><p class="muted">Manual setup key</p><code class="secret"><?= e($setup['secret']) ?></code></div></div><form method="post" action="<?= e(route('dashboard.two-factor.confirm')) ?>" class="form-stack"><?= app('csrf')->input() ?><label class="field">Six-digit confirmation code<input name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" required></label><button class="button" type="submit">Confirm and enable</button></form></div>
